      },
      {
        "id": "rules",
        "title": "Integration rules",
        "mode": "note",
        "text": [
          "Reverse and cyclic dependencies are forbidden. Shared depends on no business module; all modules may depend on it.",
          "Only infra-core declares dida-starter dependencies and depends on shared.",
          "Service, job and business starters depend on infra-core; the SDK depends only on shared.",
          "Business projects do not directly declare third-party JARs; configuration is centralized.",
          "Versions, status and rules are reference-document claims, without Dida source verification."
        ]
      }
